gned to a Factory, productivity +25%"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Perfumer's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"RIN-Y: \"Aegean's Kiss\"","mission":{"requirement1":"Complete a total of 5 battles; In each battle, a non- Support Perfumer must be deployed once at least","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 3-4 with a 3-star rating; only a non-Support Perfumer is allowed as the only Medic Operator"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +55 , ATK +25","effectLabel":"Trait improved","effectText":"Restores the HP of 4 allied units simultaneously","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Oriron Cluster","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":20000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +75 , ATK +35","effectLabel":"Lavender's Fragrance improved","effectText":"When deployed, restores the HP of all allies by 6% of Perfumer's ATK each second","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":15},{"name":"Semi-Synthetic Solvent","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":25000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +90 , ATK +40","effectLabel":"Lavender's Fragrance improved","effectText":"When deployed, restores the HP of all allies by 6.5% of Perfumer's ATK each second","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":5},{"name":"Loxic Kohl","quantity":6},{"name":"LMD","quantity":30000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Lena the Perfumer is from a renowned, well-off\nMinoan\nfamily, unfamiliar with the ways of the world. Her race prides themselves on their keen sense of smell, but hers is outstanding even among the\nVulpo\n, giving Lena a special edge in the world of perfume making.\nShe joined\nRhodes Island\nthrough regular application channels, overseeing the \"Convalescence Garden\" and providing assistance to operators as needed.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":45,"base":{"hp":710,"atk":117,"def":69,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":14,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"max":{"hp":960,"atk":189,"def":92,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":14,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"rangeId":"y-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":60,"base":{"hp":960,"atk":189,"def":92,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"max":{"hp":1232,"atk":256,"def":120,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"rangeId":"y-2"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1232,"atk":256,"def":120,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"max":{"hp":1560,"atk":320,"def":145,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":1,"interval":2.85},"rangeId":"y-2"}],"trust":{"hp":150,"atk":25,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests on this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 3% \nMinor infection, no signs of crystal formation. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.2u/L \nNo immediate physical threat, more observation required."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Lena's uncanny sense of smell made her who she is today. She can sniff out a particular good at the marketplace, or track down any individual at Rhodes Island with her nose alone. She could probably earn a decent living off those abilities, but her perfectionist bent ultimately led her to the craft of medicinal perfumes. It's a challenge for Lena, but one she accepted and dominated through her diligence and commitment to the idea that combining perfume with modern medicine would open up new possibilities (especially in the field of psychology)."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Lena was raised in a prosperous family without having to work for a living, allowing her to pursue her passions with little to no risk. She loved nature, plants, and especially the smell of flowers and sunshine. Choosing to become a perfumer was her way of expressing that passion. \nLena worked hard and dedicated herself to her perfumes, eventually deciding to develop her own business without help from her family. In the early stages, she struggled due to her inexperience. Nothing was going right. But with pride and confidence befitting the member of a prestigious clan, she turned setbacks into motivation and pushed past the lows. \nWhenever she lifted up one of her plants with mud-covered hands, she would feel invigorated by the scent of a brand new aroma."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"While working at the Convalescent Garden at Rhodes Island, she, with Dr. Kal'tsit's permission, converted an unused space into a little greenhouse. She moved her plants there and set up a perfume workshop. \nThe aromatic blends she made with different plants could elicit intense feelings and even hallucinations. She used it as an auxiliary therapy that proved helpful to the mentally ill patients partially affected by Oripathy."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"While running the Convalescent Garden, Lena's gentleness, patience and understanding, as well as the intoxicating aromas of her perfumes, made her a favorite among the operators. \nWith assistance from the medical staff, Lena started accepting some patients needing therapy. The most notable case has been Operator Nightmare, a weak Feline suffering from a split personality caused by Oripathy. Under Lena's care, Nightmare's condition has come under control and the two are now great friends. \nAmong the crowd frequenting the greenhouse, the Doctor caught Lena's notice. Lena has made it a personal mission to care for the Doctor."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Perfumer%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Perfumer%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Perfumer%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Perfumer%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Leisurely Afternoon","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Perfumer%20-%20Leisurely%20Afternoon.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Perfumer%20-%20Leisurely%20Afternoon.webp"},{"label":"Species Plantarum","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/Perfumer%20-%20Species%20Plantarum.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/Perfumer%20-%20Species%20Plantarum.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Leisurely Afternoon":"15 OP","Species Plantarum":"40 DC / 400 UC"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit - Esperanta","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Kal'tsit%20-%20Esperanta%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When other allies enter this unit's Attack Range, they will immediately gain 1 Shield and be granted a buff, healing by 60 ( +10 ) HP per second for 30 seconds (This effect is unable to be stacked and the healing effect is doubled for [Rhodes Island] Operators).","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Angelina the Mellow Wish","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Angelina%20the%20Mellow%20Wish%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Ascalon","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Ascalon%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"oper